      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Lying about stock will definitely backfire and severely damage brand trust, making the short-term sales gain worthless in the long run. Instead of lying, use \"waitlist\" urgency, like \"Due to extreme demand, pre-order now to guarantee a watch in the next release.\" This maintains the illusion of high demand and necessary commitment without fabricating a false, temporary inventory lie.",
