    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the waitlist thing is interesting, but it might slow down the immediate cash flow we need this quarter. we have so much inventory sitting there right now that pretty much needs to move to hit our margin targets. if we don't push the scarcity angle hard, we're just sitting on capital. is there any way to frame the 'limited time' or 'limited availability' without it being an outright lie about the physical count in the warehouse?",
